# Build output and your stock firmware stay out of the repository:
# nothing of Elektron's may be committed.
build/
*.syx
*.bin
!src/sampler_icons/*.bin
*.o
*.elf
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
*.payload.json
model-tg*.json
# ...except the web flasher's patch, which holds only Model-TG's own bytes
# (build.py --flasher checks it; docs/FLASHER.md)
!flasher/model-tg.json
